"""Generate and open Dagric's branded app-store landing page.

The catalog shown here is static, but every run can include a migration-aware
"Windows replacements" section sourced from:

* `~/Dagric-Continuity-Report.json` (generated by dagric-migrate)
* `~/Dagric-Continuity-Report.html` as a fallback signal of where the report
  existed and what to trust when JSON fails.

Nothing in this page changes the host machine. It is plain HTML plus badges and
install notes meant to guide installation from Discover, APT and Flathub.
"""

